"Click a shortcut to record a new key combination. It must include ⌘ or ⌃. Some shortcuts may be reserved by macOS or another app." = "點按快速鍵以錄製新的組合鍵。組合鍵必須包含 ⌘ 或 ⌃。某些快速鍵可能已被 macOS 或其他 App 保留。";
"This shortcut needs ⌘ or ⌃. Click it to record a new one." = "此快速鍵需要包含 ⌘ 或 ⌃。點按它以錄製新的快速鍵。";
"System Mount Rule Update Cancelled" = "由於已取消管理者密碼提示，MountMate 未更新 /etc/fstab 中的啟動規則。在更新之前，macOS 啟動時可能仍會使用舊規則。";
"A previous connection attempt to “%@” is still in progress." = "之前連線到「%@」的嘗試仍在進行中。";
"MountMate could not determine whether “%@” is an external disk, so it was not ejected. Try again in a moment." = "MountMate 無法確定「%@」是否為外接磁碟，因此未將其退出。請稍後再試。";
"Remove Anyway" = "仍要移除";
"“%@” could not be unmounted, so it stays mounted. You can still remove it from MountMate; no files on the share are touched.\n\n%@" = "無法卸載「%@」，因此它仍保持掛載。你仍可將其從 MountMate 中移除；共享上的檔案不會受到影響。\n\n%@";
"“%@” is already connected, probably under a different server name (for example in Finder). Disconnect it there and try again." = "「%@」已連線，可能使用了不同的伺服器名稱（例如在 Finder 中）。請在那裡中斷連線後再試一次。";

/* APFS saved password */
"Forget Saved Password" = "忘記已儲存的密碼";
"Password Not Saved" = "密碼未儲存";
"“%@” is unlocked, but MountMate could not save its password to the Keychain (error %d)." = "「%@」已解鎖，但 MountMate 無法將其密碼儲存到鑰匙圈（錯誤 %d）。";

/* Network share mount errors: causes, hints and error codes */
"MountMate tried to sign in as “%@” in the domain “%@”." = "MountMate 嘗試以「%@」身分登入網域「%@」。";
"If the account belongs to a Windows domain, enter the username as DOMAIN\\user or user@domain." = "如果該帳號屬於 Windows 網域，請將使用者名稱輸入為 DOMAIN\\user 或 user@domain。";
"Error code: %d (%@)" = "錯誤代碼：%d（%@）";
"Error code: %d" = "錯誤代碼：%d";
"The server “%@” requires a username and password. Enter them in the share’s settings." = "伺服器「%@」需要使用者名稱和密碼。請在共享的設定中輸入。";
"The password for “%@” has expired or must be changed. Change it on the server (for example by signing in on a Windows PC of the domain), then enter the new password in MountMate." = "「%@」的密碼已過期或必須變更。請在伺服器上變更密碼（例如登入網域中的一台 Windows 電腦），然後在 MountMate 中輸入新密碼。";
"The server rejected the password for “%@” because of its password policy. Ask the server’s administrator." = "由於密碼原則，伺服器拒絕了「%@」的密碼。請聯絡伺服器管理員。";
"The account for “%@” is restricted: it may be locked, disabled or not allowed to sign in at this time. Ask the server’s administrator." = "「%@」的帳號受到限制：可能已被鎖定、停用，或目前不允許登入。請聯絡伺服器管理員。";
"The server “%@” offers no sign-in method this Mac supports. Ask its administrator to allow NTLMv2 or Kerberos sign-in." = "伺服器「%@」不提供此 Mac 支援的登入方式。請要求管理員允許 NTLMv2 或 Kerberos 登入。";
"The server “%@” supports no protocol version this Mac can use. For SMB, ask its administrator to enable SMB 2 or SMB 3." = "伺服器「%@」不支援此 Mac 可用的任何通訊協定版本。若為 SMB，請要求管理員啟用 SMB 2 或 SMB 3。";
"The server “%@” refused the connection. Check that file sharing (%@) is turned on on the server." = "伺服器「%@」拒絕了連線。請檢查伺服器上是否已開啟檔案共享（%@）。";
"Check the spelling of the share name; it is the name the server shares, not a folder path on its disk." = "請檢查共享名稱的拼寫；它是伺服器共享的名稱，而不是其磁碟上的檔案夾路徑。";
"The server “%@” has no shares available to this account." = "伺服器「%@」沒有可供此帳號使用的共享。";
"Check that this account is allowed to use the share." = "請檢查此帳號是否有權使用該共享。";
"If it stopped working after a server update, ask the administrator whether the server still accepts SMB 2 or SMB 3 with NTLMv2 sign-in." = "如果問題出現在伺服器更新之後，請詢問管理員伺服器是否仍接受使用 NTLMv2 登入的 SMB 2 或 SMB 3。";

/* Unmount When Idle */
"Unmount When Idle" = "閒置時卸載";
"Unmount When Idle (Off While Kept Mounted)" = "閒置時卸載（保持掛載時無法使用）";
"Off" = "關閉";
"After %d min Without Use" = "%d 分鐘未使用後";
"No Volumes Unmounted When Idle" = "沒有閒置時卸載的磁碟卷";
"Right-click a volume on an external drive and choose “Unmount When Idle” to unmount it after some minutes without reads or writes. A volume still in use stays mounted and is tried again later." = "在外接磁碟上的磁碟卷按右鍵並選擇「閒置時卸載」，即可在數分鐘沒有讀寫後將其卸載。仍在使用的磁碟卷會保持掛載，稍後再試。";
"Failed to mount “%@” because it is currently in use by “%@”." = "無法掛載「%@」，因為它目前正被「%@」使用。";
"Failed to mount “%@” because it is currently in use by another application." = "無法掛載「%@」，因為它目前正被其他應用程式使用。";
"An unknown error occurred while trying to mount “%@”." = "嘗試掛載「%@」時發生未知錯誤。";
"Failed to unmount “%@” because it is currently in use by “%@”." = "無法卸載「%@」，因為它目前正被「%@」使用。";
"Failed to unmount “%@” because it is currently in use by another application." = "無法卸載「%@」，因為它目前正被其他應用程式使用。";
"An unknown error occurred while trying to unmount “%@”." = "嘗試卸載「%@」時發生未知錯誤。";
"Failed to eject “%@” because it is currently in use by “%@”." = "無法推出「%@」，因為它目前正被「%@」使用。";
"Failed to eject “%@” because it is currently in use by another application." = "無法推出「%@」，因為它目前正被其他應用程式使用。";
"An unknown error occurred while trying to eject “%@”." = "嘗試推出「%@」時發生未知錯誤。";
"Accessibility Busy" = "進行中";
"Accessibility Error" = "錯誤";

/* Notifications */
"Notifications" = "通知";
"Notifies you when Keep Alive cannot reconnect a mount and when it is back, when a blocked disk could not be unmounted, when unmounting before sleep took too long, and when a volume is unmounted because it was idle." = "在「保持作用中」無法重新連線掛載項目及其恢復時、無法退出被阻擋的磁碟時、睡眠前退出耗時過長時，以及卷宗因閒置而被退出時通知你。";
"Notifications for MountMate are turned off in System Settings." = "MountMate 的通知已在「系統設定」中關閉。";
"Open Notification Settings" = "打開通知設定";
"Reconnected" = "已重新連線";
"“%@” is mounted again." = "「%@」已重新掛載。";
"Cannot Reconnect" = "無法重新連線";
"MountMate couldn't reconnect “%@”. It will keep trying." = "MountMate 無法重新連線「%@」，將繼續嘗試。";
"Blocked Disk Still Mounted" = "被阻擋的磁碟仍在掛載中";
"MountMate couldn't unmount the blocked volume “%@”, probably because it is in use." = "MountMate 無法退出被阻擋的卷宗「%@」，可能是因為它正在使用中。";
"Unmount Before Sleep Unfinished" = "睡眠前退出未完成";
"Some disks were still unmounting when the Mac went to sleep. Check that they are unmounted before disconnecting them." = "Mac 進入睡眠時部分磁碟仍在退出中。中斷連線前請確認它們已退出。";

/* Network share errors and bulk eject */
"Cannot create mount point at “%1$@”.\n\nThis location requires administrator privileges. Please use a path within your home folder (e.g., ~/mountmate/%2$@) or leave the Custom Mount Point empty to use the default location." = "無法在「%1$@」建立掛載點。\n\n此位置需要管理者權限。請使用個人資料夾中的路徑（例如 ~/mountmate/%2$@），或將自訂掛載點留空以使用預設位置。";
"Failed to create mount point at “%1$@”: %2$@" = "無法在「%1$@」建立掛載點：%2$@";
"Invalid share configuration" = "分享設定無效";
"Could not mount “%1$@” at “%2$@”.\n\nThe mount location requires administrator privileges. Please use a path within your home folder (e.g., ~/mountmate/%1$@) or leave the Custom Mount Point empty to use the default location." = "無法將「%1$@」掛載到「%2$@」。\n\n此掛載位置需要管理者權限。請使用個人資料夾中的路徑（例如 ~/mountmate/%1$@），或將自訂掛載點留空以使用預設位置。";
"Could not eject: %@" = "無法推出：%@";

"Copy Path" = "拷貝路徑";
"Open in Terminal" = "在終端機中開啟";
"Automatically check for updates" = "自動檢查更新";
